## Unified Queue Rules

Local tracks and compatible licensed streaming tracks may participate in one queue where their respective provider terms permit.

Each queue entry must retain:

- Source provider.
- Provider track ID.
- Local file URI where relevant.
- Track metadata.
- Playback reference.
- Artwork reference.
- Available capabilities.

Some providers may not allow their content to be combined with third-party music.

For these sources, preserve a separate playback context and launch the official application when necessary.

Never pretend every provider supports every queue operation.

## Playlist Management

